* Return whether a shortcut only contains "key" information only or not.  If true, only the
* following fields are available.
* <ul>
*     <li>{@link #getId()}
*     <li>{@link #getPackage()}
*     <li>{@link #getActivity()}
*     <li>{@link #getLastChangedTimestamp()}
*     <li>{@link #isDynamic()}
*     <li>{@link #isPinned()}
*     <li>{@link #isDeclaredInManifest()}
*     <li>{@link #isImmutable()}
*     <li>{@link #isEnabled()}
*     <li>{@link #getUserHandle()}
* </ul>
